  "notes": [
    "Generated pose derivatives are not exact multi-view 3D renders.",
    "Four full-scene paintings have camera/prop differences; transition with a brief fade, never interpolate them as aligned construction layers.",
    "Motion clips are cutout/transform animations, not skeletal rigs or frame-by-frame walk cycles.",
    "No cold, snow, injury, captivity or antagonist art is included.",
    "Gameplay, economy, persistent state and existing UI files are not modified."
  ],
